---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---
<Base title="About — Aurora Coffee">
  <Hero
    heading="About us"
    tagline="Two people, one drum roaster, zero shortcuts."
  />
  <p>
    Aurora started in a garage with a popcorn popper and too much ambition.
    Eight years later we are still small on purpose: every roast is tasted
    before it ships, and every farm we buy from is one we can name.
  </p>
  <p>
    Questions about wholesale or just want to argue about grind size? Come by
    on a Saturday — the espresso machine is always on.
  </p>
</Base>
